[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/semver_solver_multi/lib/semver_core.py: Implement SemVer interface: concrete non-frozen dataclass exceptions with message formatting, immutable Version with canonical format/str and is_prerelease, VersionEngine protocol with operation stubs.
[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/semver_solver_multi/lib/semver_core_impl.py: Implement VersionEngine: SemVer 2.0.0 regex parsing with leading-zero rejection and InvalidVersionError, numeric component comparison, prerelease numeric/lexicographic ordering with numeric-lower-than-string and longer-sequence precedence, build metadata ignored.
[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/semver_solver_multi/lib/semver_range.py: Implement range interface: InvalidRangeError dataclass, immutable VersionRange with raw text str, RangeEngine protocol operation stubs.
[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/semver_solver_multi/lib/semver_range_impl.py: Implement RangeEngine: strict range syntax validation (empty/whitespace, empty union clauses, commas, bare partials, hyphen forms, whitespace-delimited comparators, optional operator whitespace) and DNF satisfaction with caret/tilde/wildcard/hyphen expansion plus prerelease filtering by targeting triple.
[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/semver_solver_multi/tests/semver_core_impl_test.py: Author VersionEngine unit tests: SemVer 2.0.0 parsing (full record, zero components, optional prerelease/build segments), leading-zero and malformed grammar errors carrying raw_text, and precedence contracts (tri-state, numeric components, normal>prerelease, canonical prerelease chain, numeric<string identifiers, build metadata excluded).
[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/semver_solver_multi/tests/semver_range_impl_test.py: Author RangeEngine unit tests: trimmed range text storage, supported comparator/prefix/wildcard/hyphen/union forms, bare-partial and malformed-syntax errors carrying raw_range, and matching contracts for comparator clauses, wildcard and prefix expansions, unions, hyphen ranges, operator whitespace equivalence, plus prerelease filtering, explicit prerelease targeting, and unshifted prerelease inequality (version-engine collaborator doubled via protocol registration).
[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/semver_solver_multi/tests/dependency_solver_impl_test.py: Author repository/solver unit tests: package registration membership and name enumeration, descending precedence release ordering (numeric-safe), missing-package error with package_name, defensive release list copy, and DependencySolver contracts for transitive highest-compatible assignment with derivation steps, backtracking from a conflicting newest release, contradiction and missing-package conflicts naming involved packages, and empty-root resolution (version/range engine collaborators doubled via protocol registration).
[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/semver_solver_multi/lib/dependency_solver.py: Implement dependency solver interface: PackageNotFoundError/ResolutionConflictError dataclasses, frozen PackageDependency/PackageRelease/ResolutionOutcome records, PackageRepository and DependencySolver protocols with operation stubs.
[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/semver_solver_multi/lib/dependency_solver_impl.py: Implement PackageRepository (descending-precedence release index, PackageNotFoundError on missing lookups, defensive copies) and DependencySolver (MRV backtracking search over descending candidates, forward-checked transitive constraints, conflict trail, ResolutionConflictError without escaping PackageNotFoundError, ResolutionOutcome with derivation steps).
